# Clean Architecture + Hexagonal (JSON Mais)

## Onde colocar código

| Tipo | Camada | Pasta |
|------|--------|-------|
| Entity / VO | Domain | `src/api/JsonMais.Domain/` |
| Port | Application | `src/api/JsonMais.Application/Ports/` |
| Use Case | Application | `.../Application/UseCases/` |
| Adapter | Infrastructure | `src/api/JsonMais.Infrastructure/` |
| Minimal APIs | Web | `src/api/JsonMais.Web/` |
| Pages / editor UI | Presentation | `src/web/src/presentation/` |
| Domínio JSON (TS) | Shared | `src/web/src/shared/json/` |
| API clients | Shared | `src/web/src/shared/api/` |
| Router | Composition | `src/web/src/composition/` |

## Regra de dependência

```text
React presentation → shared/json (domínio) + vanilla-jsoneditor (adapter UI)
React presentation → API HTTP (health/sessão)
Web → Application → Domain
Infrastructure → Application/Domain
shared/json → (nada de React, nada do motor visual)
```

## Testes

- Domain C#: SessionId / SessionRecord sem ASP.NET
- `shared/json`: format, compact, diff, persistência — Vitest, sem DOM
- React: workspace do editor sem chamar API para o documento
